# Lab: Phat hien vi tri audio bi chinh sua bang fragile tamper-location watermark.
# Muc tieu:
# 1. Tao file WAV PCM16 lam vat chua.
# 2. Nhung hash rut gon cua tung block vao chinh block audio.
# 3. Xac minh file marked.wav con nguyen ven.
# 4. Tao file tampered.wav bang cach sua mot khoang thoi gian.
# 5. Dung verify_blocks.py de khoanh vung block va moc thoi gian bi sua.

